Native PTQ1 support
===================
The PTQ1 decode, shared-memory operand staging, and CUDA projection kernels are adapted from
1314521gjy/ninfer-fusion-kvmem, commit b6e6c20deb93fe5ed84e5715642dad21c0455ef0:
https://github.com/1314521gjy/ninfer-fusion-kvmem
The donor source is distributed under Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE). Its PTQ1 kernels also
credit the shensanshu/Ada ternary implementation and PrismML's PTQ1_0 decoding definition.

Changes made here: integrated the current v3 artifact format and current Op interfaces;
preserved existing format IDs, T2 routes and architecture bounds; made activation layouts and
workspace planning format-aware; fused inverse-rotated PTQ1 embedding with a single BF16 output
rounding; added an artifact-owned codec, conversion recipe and independent numerical tests.
